  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t08_01",
      "hash64": "55B19358443CF0E7",
      "text": "冰櫃鎮是\\n白雪與鎮魂的城鎮！\\r\\n最近演唱會會場也很有名喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t08_02",
      "hash64": "55B19458443CF29A",
      "text": "雪花飄飄！\\n燭光搖搖！\\c\\n每天都像過節日一樣吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t08_06",
      "hash64": "55B19058443CEBCE",
      "text": "滑雪山就是現在最潮的娛樂！\\n在霜抹山可以挑戰喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t08_08",
      "hash64": "55B18A58443CE19C",
      "text": "雪童子很可愛吧！\\n只有雌性的雪童子\\r\\n才有可能進化成雪妖女。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t08_20",
      "hash64": "55B7FE5844421266",
      "text": "今天也好冷啊……\\n吃一些辣的料理來暖暖身體！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t08_22",
      "hash64": "55B7FC5844420F00",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳知道究極的三明治嗎？\\n那個三明治的名稱裡有「大師」兩個字，\\r\\n至於食譜則一切不詳……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t08_23",
      "hash64": "55B7FD58444210B3",
      "text": "在外面吃的話，\\n感覺比平常更好吃～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t08_26",
      "hash64": "55B80058444215CC",
      "text": "１年半前，\\n道館館主的泰姆引退，\\r\\n由她的妹妹萊姆接棒了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t08_28",
      "hash64": "55B8065844421FFE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看過萊姆的演唱會嗎？\\n聽了靈魂可會感動到顫抖喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t08_29",
      "hash64": "55B80758444221B1",
      "text": "道館測驗的時候紫色的舞台會發光，\\n很漂亮喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
